{
 "duration": 50.83,
 "scenes": [
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "You can move a thousand times faster than everyone else.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "ws": 0.0,
   "we": 3.22,
   "end": 3.46
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "To you, the world almost stops.",
   "start": 3.46,
   "ws": 3.58,
   "we": 5.76,
   "end": 6.24
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "But unlike frozen time, light still reaches you. You can see.",
   "start": 6.24,
   "ws": 6.36,
   "we": 10.58,
   "end": 11.0
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "text": "Then you take a step.",
   "start": 11.0,
   "ws": 11.12,
   "we": 12.5,
   "end": 12.5
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "text": "Walking speed, times a thousand, is five thousand kilometres an hour.",
   "start": 12.5,
   "ws": 12.5,
   "we": 17.12,
   "end": 17.48
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "text": "Four times the speed of sound.",
   "start": 17.48,
   "ws": 17.6,
   "we": 19.22,
   "end": 19.56
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "text": "The air hits you like a wall.",
   "start": 19.56,
   "ws": 19.68,
   "we": 21.28,
   "end": 21.62
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "text": "Your skin heats up hotter than an oven.",
   "start": 21.62,
   "ws": 21.74,
   "we": 23.78,
   "end": 24.16
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "text": "Every step makes a sonic boom that shatters windows.",
   "start": 24.16,
   "ws": 24.28,
   "we": 27.34,
   "end": 27.74
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "text": "You could even sprint across a lake without sinking.",
   "start": 27.74,
   "ws": 27.86,
   "we": 30.82,
   "end": 31.12
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "text": "But you're starving.",
   "start": 31.12,
   "ws": 31.24,
   "we": 32.46,
   "end": 32.9
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "text": "Just speeding up burns about sixteen thousand calories.",
   "start": 32.9,
   "ws": 33.02,
   "we": 36.12,
   "end": 36.34
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "text": "That's eight days of food, every time you start running.",
   "start": 36.34,
   "ws": 36.46,
   "we": 39.36,
   "end": 39.51
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "text": "And it gets worse.",
   "start": 39.51,
   "ws": 39.62,
   "we": 40.58,
   "end": 40.58
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "text": "One day for everyone else lasts almost three years for you.",
   "start": 40.58,
   "ws": 40.58,
   "we": 44.88,
   "end": 45.24
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "text": "Your friend blinks... and you've grown old.",
   "start": 45.24,
   "ws": 45.36,
   "we": 47.74,
   "end": 48.2
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "text": "So, would you still want super speed?",
   "start": 48.2,
   "ws": 48.32,
   "we": 50.54,
   "end": 50.83
  }
 ],
